OL,3,GNEWSAVillage green granted protected
OL,4,Acommunity status
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village green with no registered
OL,7,Fowner has been granted protected
OL,8,Fcommunity status.
OL,10,FThe land at Great Broughton, near
OL,11,FStokesley, has been maintained and
OL,12,Fmanaged by the parish council since the
OL,13,Flate 1960s.
OL,15,FA report by North Yorkshire Council
OL,16,Frevealed it is not registered with HM
OL,17,FLand Registry, meaning its legal
OL,18,Fownership cannot currently be verified.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
