OL,3,GNEWSAVillage green granted protected
OL,4,Acommunity status
OL,5,
OL,6,FDesignating the area on the High Street
OL,7,Fas an asset of community value means
OL,8,Fvillagers would be given the
OL,9,Fopportunity to buy the land if any
OL,10,Ffuture owner sought to sell it.
